{"title":"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/a/3eabe6c97f03e413d1aa3c292e9478f286e64df1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$o$\" width=\"9\" height=\"8\" /> be an odd whole number and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> be any whole number.  Which of the following statements about the whole number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/c/eec69236f94da20dccc1356573869ef622aea4e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(o^2+no)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"74\" height=\"21\" /> is always true?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/c/45c86d34aebab2eb369983afbac0cf1dcf4c3aa6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\text{it is always odd} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\text{it is always even}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"326\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/6/e8621b899702c159bae1d448fcf7cca87e7b64a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(C)}\\ \\text{it is even only if } n \\text{ is even} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\text{it is odd only if } n \\text{ is odd}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"463\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/0/1b062dcf5f03e8fe1a5d7af1c5c0ad8d80b4a367.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(E)}\\ \\text{it is odd only if } n \\text{ is even}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"215\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/a/3eabe6c97f03e413d1aa3c292e9478f286e64df1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$o$\" width=\"9\" height=\"8\" /> is odd, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/5/6452c8d816a404958fb22044b10011835a68ffba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$o^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> must be odd.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is odd, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/c/97cf47ebc7fe028a151933d47132e69e1bd2cc1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$no$\" width=\"20\" height=\"8\" /> is odd, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/f/83f74b6e5d08131b07bc810fbe040aa86fdd14a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$o^2 + no$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"18\" /> is even.  \n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is even, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/c/97cf47ebc7fe028a151933d47132e69e1bd2cc1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$no$\" width=\"20\" height=\"8\" /> is even, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/f/83f74b6e5d08131b07bc810fbe040aa86fdd14a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$o^2 + no$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"18\" /> is odd.\n</p><p>Therefore, of the answer choices, only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/2/c0237a0e4a048d2cbde4c0ee5059f48a4fc80743.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{it is odd only if } n \\text{ is even}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"229\" height=\"30\" /> accurately describes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/f/83f74b6e5d08131b07bc810fbe040aa86fdd14a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$o^2 + no$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We are given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/1/df1b717a3960b836b9c2425819ca36f9bdac68e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{o}\\equiv 1\\pmod{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" />, so in mod <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/8/e68f2d0e9626a0713a9874b013cb35ec23a8882c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1^2+1(n) = n+1\\]\" width=\"136\" height=\"19\" /> which is odd only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/d/14d2e4b54e707fd0fe6fbc065fa544228ec01c6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{n}$\" width=\"9\" height=\"7\" /> is even <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/a/8ea2e109f88a65cc29fbc7b83521f1da6100df6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rightarrow \\boxed{\\text{E}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"46\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 3 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/f/53f720e7469639f91586f4351f7f3ef51cab5a8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$o = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/8/598a16d4b7dde3dec3a390109882d54bb0308ea5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 2$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/1/7f1195ebef5bd88f9b406e2fb11242c588e59003.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$o^2 + no = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" />, which eliminates (B) and (D).  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/f/53f720e7469639f91586f4351f7f3ef51cab5a8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$o = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/6/c766f9fce6070981e62f805a7cf7294baed4498e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/b/0cb9752d798b0894cd1eee09ba0a73ed48e8960a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$o^2 + no = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" />, which eliminates (A) and (C).  This leaves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/2/c0237a0e4a048d2cbde4c0ee5059f48a4fc80743.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{it is odd only if } n \\text{ is even}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"229\" height=\"30\" /> as the correct answer.\n</p><p>~sakshamsethi, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME\" title=\"1986 AJHSME\">1986 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1986\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"